    "background_story": "Drew was a free-spirited bartender who brought a taste of Italy to the small coastal town where he worked. His signature cocktail, the 'Sicilian Spritz', was a refreshing blend of citrus, sparkling wine, and a hint of bitters. Every summer evening, Drew would expertly mix and pour his famous drink, garnishing each glass with a sprig of rosemary and a slice of orange. As the sun dipped into the ocean, the sound of laughter and clinking glasses filled the air, with Drew at the center, always ready to spritz a new round and regale his patrons with tales of his travels. His infectious enthusiasm and creative concoctions made his beachside bar a beloved gathering spot, where strangers became friends over a glass of Drew's signature spritz.",
